    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN253.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">talaimakaṉ piriviṉkaṇ vēṟupaṭṭa talaimakaṭkut tōḻi colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante said to HER who had undergone changes during the separation from HIM.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN253.1">
        <l>vaika ṟōṟum pacalai pāyaveṉ</l>
        <l>meyyum perumpiṟi tākiṉ ṟoy<supplied>ye</supplied>ṉa</l>
        <l>vaṉṉaiyu mamarā muka<supplied>tta</supplied> ḷalarē</l>
        <l>vāṭāp pūviṟ koṅka rōṭṭi</l>
        <l>nā<supplied>ṭupa</supplied>la tanta pacumpūṭ pāṇṭiyaṉ</l>
        <l>poṉmali neṭunakark kūṭa lāṭiya</l>
        <l>viṉṉicai yārppiṉum peritē yiṅkiyāṉ</l>
        <l>cilanā ḷuyyaleṉ pōṉmeṉap palaniṉain</l>
        <l>tāḻal vāḻi tōḻi vāṭāa</l>
        <l>tāriru ṇaṭunā ḷērā yuyyap</l>
        <l>pakaipuṉai yaṟuttup palliṉañ cāayk </l>
        <l>kaṇañcāl kōvalar neṭuviḷip payiraṟi<supplied>n</supplied></l>
        <l>tiṉantalait tarūun tuḷaṅkimi ṉallēṟṟut</l>
        <l>taḻūuppiṇa reruttan tāḻap pūṭṭiya</l>
        <l>vantūm paka<supplied>la</supplied>maik kamañcelap peyta</l>
        <l>tuṟutāḻ valciyar toḻuvarai vavvik</l>
        <l>kaṉṟuṭaip perunirai maṉṟuniṟai tarūu</l>
        <l>nēra vaṉṟōḷ vaṭukar perumakaṉ</l>
        <l>pēricai yerumai naṉṉāṭ ṭuḷḷatai</l>
        <l>yayiriyā ṟiṟantaṉa rāyiṉu mayariṟan</l>
        <l>tuḷḷupa tilla tāmē paṇaittōṭ</l>
        <l>kurumpai meṉmulai yarumpiya cuṇaṅku</l>
        <l>nucuppaḻin to<supplied>li</supplied>varun tāḻiruṅ kūntaṉ</l>
        <l>māka vicumpiṟ ṟilakamoṭu pa<supplied>ti</supplied>tta</l>
        <l>tiṅka ḷaṉṉaniṉ ṟirumukat</l>
        <l>toṇcūṭ ṭavirkuḻai malainta nōkkē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1">“While day by day pallor spreads, my</l>
        <l corresp="2">body is undergoing the great other, and suddenly</l>
        <l corresp="3">mother has a face that is not content. The gossip,</l>
        <l corresp="7a-c">it is louder that the din of sweet music</l>
        <l corresp="6">when Kūṭal danced, with large mansions abounding in gold,</l>
        <l corresp="5">[city of] the Pāṇṭiya with green[-golden] ornaments who brought many lands</l>
        <l corresp="4 7d">after chasing the Koṅkar with unfading flowers. Here I</l>
        <l corresp="8">will not live [even] a few [more] days, it seems,” thinking many [thoughts like these]</l>
        <l corresp="9a-c">don’t be downcast, oh friend:</l>
        <l corresp="20a-c">Even if he were to cross the Ayiri river</l>
        <l corresp="19">that is in the good land of famous Erumai,</l>
        <l corresp="18">great son of the Vaṭukar with straight strong shoulders,</l>
        <l corresp="9d-10">who, so that the fine cowherds escaped at midnight in unfailingly full darkness,</l>
        <l corresp="11">cut through the enemy arrangements, [and] as many groups were exhausted,</l>
        <l corresp="12">knowing the long summoning call of the numerous cowherds in troupes,</l>
        <l corresp="13-14a">held on to the bull with swaying good hump who takes the lead of the group,</l>
        <l corresp="16">snatched [that] mountain worshipped by those whose food is the thick ???</l>
        <l corresp="15">that pours so the fullness goes from the inner bamboo with a pretty tube</l>
        <l corresp="14b-d">that is fastened so that it hangs down from the rough neck,</l>
        <l corresp="17">[and] brought fullness to the cow shed with a big, calf-possessing herd,</l>
        <l corresp="20d-21c">going beyond delusion he must remember [it]</l>
        <l corresp="26">– the glance in opposition to the bright ornamental shining earrings</l>
        <l corresp="25">from your face luminous like a moon</l>
        <l corresp="24">that is imprinted with a Tilakam in the spacious sky,</l>
        <l corresp="23">with sprouting hanging dark tresses, dwindling at the waist</l>
        <l corresp="22">with beauty spots that budded on the breasts soft [as] tender coconuts,</l>
        <l rend="indent6" corresp="21d">with bamboo shoulders.</l>
      </lg>
